exports[`screen: 'help partner webhooks' > en 40 color 1`] = `
"  bladecp partner webhooks
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━──────────────────────────
  Manage the webhooks BladeCP sends to
  your systems

  Usage: bladecp partner webhooks
  <command> [options]

  Commands ────────────────────────────
  list
    List your webhook endpoints
  show <endpoint>
    Show an endpoint: address, events
    and status
  create
    Add an endpoint and get its signing
    secret
  update <endpoint>
    Change the address, events or name
    of an endpoint
  pause <endpoint>
    Stop sending events to an endpoint
    for now
  resume <endpoint>
    Send events to a paused endpoint
    again
  delete <endpoint>
    Delete an endpoint
  rotate-secret <endpoint>
    Replace the signing secret of an
    endpoint
  deliveries
    List what BladeCP sent and what
    your system answered
  replay <delivery>
    Send a delivery again, with the
    same event ID

  "bladecp partner webhooks" alone runs
  "bladecp partner webhooks list".
  Details of a command: bladecp partner
  webhooks <command> --help

